@api = http://localhost:8000

### List events
GET {{api}}/events?limit=5

### Create event
POST {{api}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Board games night",
  "location": "Stratford Library",
  "starts_at": "2026-11-14T18:00:00Z",
  "ends_at": "2026-11-14T21:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Invalid: ends before starts (expect 422 with fields._form)
POST {{api}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bad", "location": "X", "starts_at": "2026-11-14T18:00:00Z", "ends_at": "2026-11-14T17:00:00Z" , "capacity": 0}